    exampleHands: [
      'Setup example: 10 card(s) per player.',
      'Rule example: As the bidding team, take at least the number of card points you bid; as the opposing team, score the points you take. First team to reach 500 or more points wins.',
      "Turn-flow example: Four in fixed partnerships. Deal 10 each, 5 to nest. Bid from 100 in multiples of 5 (left of dealer first); three passes leave the fourth as high bidder; if first three pass, dealer must bid 100. Bidder picks up nest, discards five face-down (no point cards), names trump. Left of bidder leads; follow color; Rook is highest trump. Highest trump wins trick, else highest of led color. Bidder's team makes bid scores their points, else subtracts bid; other team always scores its points. Game to 500.",
      "Scoring example: Card points: 1=15, 14=10, 10=10, 5=5, Rook=20 (180 per deal). Bidder's team scores its points if they make the bid, else subtracts the bid; other team always scores its points. First team to 500 wins. First team to 500 or more; higher score wins..",
